"""
Labeled training examples for the local complaint classifier.

Each entry maps a realistic complaint description to its correct
category (matching apps.complaints.models.ComplaintCategory exactly).
Mix of English and Urdu, and a mix of formal/informal phrasing, since
real citizen complaints won't be uniformly worded.

This is intentionally a Python module (not a JSON/CSV file) so it's
version-controlled alongside the code that consumes it and easy to
extend directly — append more (text, category) tuples as real
complaint data accumulates, then re-run scripts/train_classifier.py.
"""

